vkr-dma-heap.patch: Venus host-visible memory from a Linux dma-heap, for hosts whose Vulkan driver exports no dma-buf and that have no gbm
or udmabuf. Written from a specification (see x400/CREDITS.md for how), over virglrenderer's MIT files src/venus/vkr_device_memory.c,
vkr_physical_device.c and vkr_physical_device.h (Copyright 2020 Google LLC, SPDX MIT), whose notices stay in those files.
The environment variable that overrides the heap node is VKR_DMA_HEAP_NODE (default /dev/dma_heap/system).
